egory = Beef recipes\n| Difficulty = 3\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\nThis pot roast recipe is even better than your mom made.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Each|ea]]. (2 ½ [[Cookbook:Pound|pounds]] / 1.1 [[Cookbook:Kilogram|kg]]) [[Cookbook:Beef|bottom round roast]]\n* ½ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Beef|beef]] [[Cookbook:Broth|broth]]\n* 6–8 cloves [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]], smashed and [[Cookbook:Mince|minced]]\n* [[Cookbook:Salt|Kosher salt]]\n* Freshly-ground [[Cookbook:Black Pepper|black pepper]]\n* ½ cup red [[Cookbook:Wine|wine]]\n* ¼ cup tomato juice\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Carrot|carrots]], peeled and cut into ¾-inch (2 cm) pieces\n* 1 large [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Dice|diced]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] fresh [[Cookbook:Rosemary|rosemary]], finely [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 tbsp fresh [[Cookbook:Thyme|thyme]], finely chopped\n* 2 tbsp fresh [[Cookbook:Oregano|oregano]], finely chopped\n* ½ cup [[Cookbook:Olive Oil|olive oil]], divided\n* ¼ cup [[Cookbook:Vinegar|balsamic vinegar]]\n* ⅓–½ cup [[Cookbook:All-purpose flour|all-purpose flour]]\n* 4 red-skinned [[Cookbook:Potato|potatoes]], quartered\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Season roast liberally with kosher salt and freshly-ground black pepper.\n#In a 6-quart (6-liter) [[Cookbook:Dutch Oven|Dutch oven]], heat ¼ cup olive oil over medium-high heat. Add roast and cook until browned on all sides.\n#Remove roast to a plate and keep warm.\n#Add remaining oil and vegetables. Cook until onions are lightly browned around edges.\n#Remove vegetables and keep warm.\n#[[Cookbook:Deglazing|Deglaze]] pan with broth and add remaining ingredients. Reduce heat to low, then add vegetables and beef.\n#Cover and place into a 225°F (110°C) [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] and cook 6 hours.\n#Serve warm.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using beef round]]\n[[Category:Recipes for stew]]\n[[Category:Braised recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes with metric units]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wine]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rosemary]]\n[[Category:Recipes using thyme]]\n[[Category:Recipes using oregano]]\n[[Category:Recipes using olive oil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using balsamic vinegar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using all-purpose flour]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef broth and stock]]\n[[Category:Recipes using tomato juice]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Classic Pot Roast","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 ea. (2 ½ pounds / 1.1 kg) bottom round roast","sourceText":"1 ea. (2 ½ pounds / 1.1 kg) bottom round roast","amountText":"1 ea. (2 ½ pounds / 1.1 kg) bottom round roast","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ cup beef broth","sourceText":"½ cup beef broth","amountText":"½ cup beef broth","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"6–8 cloves garlic, smashed and minced","sourceText":"6–8 cloves garlic, smashed and minced","amountText":"6–8 cloves garlic, smashed and minced","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"Kosher salt","sourceText":"Kosher salt","amountText":"Kosher salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"Freshly-ground black pepper","sourceText":"Freshly-ground black pepper","amountText":"Freshly-ground black pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"½ cup red wine","sourceText":"½ cup red wine","amountText":"½ cup red wine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"¼ cup tomato juice","sourceText":"¼ cup tomato juice","amountText":"¼ cup tomato juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"3 carrots, peeled and cut into ¾-inch (2 cm) pieces","sourceText":"3 carrots, peeled and cut into ¾-inch (2 cm) pieces","amountText":"3 carrots, peele